      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For dizziness, the best thing is to immediately find a quiet, dimly lit space and take a few slow, deep breaths. If the dizziness persists, try sipping some water and taking a few very slow walks around your area to reorient yourself. Since you hit your head, if the dizziness doesn't improve quickly, it's best to take a short break or consider letting someone else cover your shift.",
