      "content": "I strongly advise against taking any supplements without consulting a medical professional, especially after a head impact. Dizziness that persists after rest could be a sign of something more serious that needs proper evaluation. For light sensitivity, wearing sunglasses or even just a hat can help manage the glare while you are working. If the dizziness continues, please prioritize your health over your shift and seek urgent medical attention.",
